#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:6
msgid "# SAP Transport"
msgstr "# SAP 传输"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:8
msgid ""
"SAP runs over a single WebSocket per Satellite instance. Each message is one "
"UTF-8 text frame containing a JSON **envelope**."
msgstr ""
"SAP 在每个 Satellite 实例上使用单一 WebSocket 连接。每条消息是一个包含 JSON "
"**envelope** 的 UTF-8 文本帧。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:10
msgid "## Endpoint"
msgstr "## 端点"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:14
msgid "``` ws://{hub_host}:{port}/sap/v1 ```"
msgstr "``` ws://{hub_host}:{port}/sap/v1 ```"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:16
msgid ""
"Derive from Hub HTTP URL: replace `http` with `ws`, strip trailing slash, "
"append `/sap/v1`. Default Hub port: **2658**."
msgstr ""
"由 Hub HTTP URL 推导：将 `http` 替换为 `ws`，去掉末尾斜杠，追加 `/sap/v1`。"
"Hub 默认端口：**2658**。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:18
msgid ""
"Implemented in [`platform/src/sap/bun-route.ts`](../../platform/src/sap/bun-"
"route.ts) and [`packages/sap-contract/src/transport.ts`](../../packages/sap-"
"contract/src/transport.ts) (`hubWsUrl`)."
msgstr ""
"实现位于 [`platform/src/sap/bun-route.ts`](../../platform/src/sap/bun-"
"route.ts) 与 [`packages/sap-contract/src/transport.ts`](../../packages/sap-"
"contract/src/transport.ts)（`hubWsUrl`）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:20
msgid "## Envelope kinds"
msgstr "## 信封类型"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:22
msgid ""
"Defined in [`packages/sap-contract/src/protocol.ts`](../../packages/sap-"
"contract/src/protocol.ts):"
msgstr ""
"定义于 [`packages/sap-contract/src/protocol.ts`](../../packages/sap-contract/"
"src/protocol.ts)："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| `kind` | Direction | Purpose |\n"
"| ------ | --------- | ------- |\n"
"| `connect` | Satellite → Hub | First frame; handshake |\n"
"| `connected` | Hub → Satellite | Handshake reply |\n"
"| `req` | Satellite → Hub | RPC request (`id`, `method`, `payload`) |\n"
"| `res` | Hub → Satellite | RPC response (`id`, `ok`, `payload` or `error`) |\n"
"| `evt` | Both | Async event (`method`, `payload`) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| `kind` | 方向 | 用途 |\n"
"| ------ | --------- | ------- |\n"
"| `connect` | Satellite → Hub | 首帧；握手 |\n"
"| `connected` | Hub → Satellite | 握手回复 |\n"
"| `req` | Satellite → Hub | RPC 请求（`id`、`method`、`payload`） |\n"
"| `res` | Hub → Satellite | RPC 响应（`id`、`ok`、`payload` 或 `error`） |\n"
"| `evt` | Both | 异步事件（`method`、`payload`） |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:32
msgid ""
"Parse/serialize with `parseSapEnvelope` / `serializeSapEnvelope`. Invalid "
"JSON or schema → WebSocket close **1003** (`invalid frame`)."
msgstr ""
"使用 `parseSapEnvelope` / `serializeSapEnvelope` 解析/序列化。无效 JSON 或 "
"schema → WebSocket 关闭 **1003**（`invalid frame`）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:34
msgid "## Connection state machine"
msgstr "## 连接状态机"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:47
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```mermaid\n"
"stateDiagram-v2\n"
"  [*] --> Disconnected\n"
"  Disconnected --> AwaitingConnect: WebSocket open\n"
"  AwaitingConnect --> Connected: connect accepted\n"
"  AwaitingConnect --> Disconnected: invalid frame close 1003\n"
"  Connected --> Active: connected sent\n"
"  Active --> Active: req/res and evt\n"
"  Active --> Disconnected: WebSocket close\n"
"  Connected --> Disconnected: duplicate connect close 1008\n"
"  AwaitingConnect --> Disconnected: req before connect close 1008\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```mermaid\n"
"stateDiagram-v2\n"
"  [*] --> Disconnected\n"
"  Disconnected --> AwaitingConnect: WebSocket open\n"
"  AwaitingConnect --> Connected: connect accepted\n"
"  AwaitingConnect --> Disconnected: invalid frame close 1003\n"
"  Connected --> Active: connected sent\n"
"  Active --> Active: req/res and evt\n"
"  Active --> Disconnected: WebSocket close\n"
"  Connected --> Disconnected: duplicate connect close 1008\n"
"  AwaitingConnect --> Disconnected: req before connect close 1008\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:49
msgid ""
"Rules ([`platform/src/sap/ws-server.ts`](../../platform/src/sap/ws-"
"server.ts) `attachSapWebSocket`):"
msgstr ""
"规则（[`platform/src/sap/ws-server.ts`](../../platform/src/sap/ws-server.ts) "
"`attachSapWebSocket`）："

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/transport.md:53
msgid "First valid frame **must** be `connect`."
msgstr "首个有效帧**必须**为 `connect`。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/transport.md:53
msgid "Second `connect` on same socket → close **1008** (`already connected`)."
msgstr ""
"同一 socket 上第二次 `connect` → 关闭 **1008**（`already connected`）。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/transport.md:53
msgid ""
"`req` or non-heartbeat `evt` before handshake → close **1008** (`not "
"connected`)."
msgstr "握手前发送 `req` 或非心跳 `evt` → 关闭 **1008**（`not connected`）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:55
msgid "## Handshake and heartbeat"
msgstr "## 握手与心跳"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:60
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```mermaid\n"
"sequenceDiagram\n"
"  participant Sat as Satellite\n"
"  participant Hub as Hub\n"
msgstr ""
"```mermaid\n"
"sequenceDiagram\n"
"  participant Sat as Satellite\n"
"  participant Hub as Hub\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:70
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Sat->>Hub: connect app_id instance_id protocol SAP/1.0\n"
"  Hub->>Hub: registerConnection SatelliteManager\n"
"  Hub->>Sat: connected features_enabled heartbeat_interval_sec\n"
"  loop every heartbeat_interval_sec\n"
"    Sat->>Hub: evt heartbeat\n"
"    Hub->>Hub: touchHeartbeat\n"
"    Hub->>Sat: evt heartbeat ts\n"
"  end\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"  Sat->>Hub: connect app_id instance_id protocol SAP/1.0\n"
"  Hub->>Hub: registerConnection SatelliteManager\n"
"  Hub->>Sat: connected features_enabled heartbeat_interval_sec\n"
"  loop every heartbeat_interval_sec\n"
"    Sat->>Hub: evt heartbeat\n"
"    Hub->>Hub: touchHeartbeat\n"
"    Hub->>Sat: evt heartbeat ts\n"
"  end\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:72
msgid "### `connect` payload"
msgstr "### `connect` payload"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:74
msgid ""
"Schema: [`frames/lifecycle.ts`](../../packages/sap-contract/src/frames/"
"lifecycle.ts) `connectPayloadSchema`."
msgstr ""
"Schema：[`frames/lifecycle.ts`](../../packages/sap-contract/src/frames/"
"lifecycle.ts) `connectPayloadSchema`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:83
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field | Required | Role |\n"
"| ----- | -------- | ---- |\n"
"| `app_id` | yes | Satellite app id (e.g. `pair-programming`) |\n"
"| `instance_id` | yes | Stable or generated instance UUID |\n"
"| `protocol` | yes | Must be `SAP/1.0` |\n"
"| `features_requested` | no | Feature flags (Hub echoes as `features_enabled`) |\n"
"| `http_url` | no | Satellite UI URL for Chamber → Satellites |\n"
"| `instance_label` | no | Display label |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 字段 | 必填 | 作用 |\n"
"| ----- | -------- | ---- |\n"
"| `app_id` | yes | Satellite 应用 id（例如 `pair-programming`） |\n"
"| `instance_id` | yes | 稳定或生成的实例 UUID |\n"
"| `protocol` | yes | 必须为 `SAP/1.0` |\n"
"| `features_requested` | no | 功能标志（Hub 回显为 `features_enabled`） |\n"
"| `http_url` | no | Satellite UI URL，供 Chamber → Satellites 使用 |\n"
"| `instance_label` | no | 显示标签 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:85
msgid "### `connected` payload"
msgstr "### `connected` payload"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:92
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field | Role |\n"
"| ----- | ---- |\n"
"| `protocol` | `SAP/1.0` |\n"
"| `features_enabled` | Enabled features |\n"
"| `server_info` | `anima_version`, `sap_version`, `platform_for_app` map |\n"
"| `heartbeat_interval_sec` | Hub default: 30 |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 字段 | 作用 |\n"
"| ----- | ---- |\n"
"| `protocol` | `SAP/1.0` |\n"
"| `features_enabled` | 已启用的功能 |\n"
"| `server_info` | `anima_version`、`sap_version`、`platform_for_app` 映射 |\n"
"| `heartbeat_interval_sec` | Hub 默认值：30 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:94
msgid "### Heartbeat"
msgstr "### 心跳"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:96
msgid ""
"Satellite sends `evt { method: \"heartbeat\" }` on an interval derived from "
"`heartbeat_interval_sec`. Hub updates `last_heartbeat_at` and replies with "
"`evt { method: \"heartbeat\", payload: { ts } }`."
msgstr ""
"Satellite 按 `heartbeat_interval_sec` 推导的间隔发送 `evt { method: "
"\"heartbeat\" }`。Hub 更新 `last_heartbeat_at` 并以 `evt { method: "
"\"heartbeat\", payload: { ts } }` 回复。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:98
msgid ""
"`runSapTransport` in sap-contract starts the heartbeat timer automatically "
"after connect. Hub does not actively disconnect idle satellites based on "
"missed heartbeats today."
msgstr ""
"sap-contract 中的 `runSapTransport` 在 connect 后自动启动心跳定时器。目前 "
"Hub 不会因错过心跳而主动断开空闲 Satellite。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:100
msgid "## Reconnect"
msgstr "## 重连"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:102
msgid ""
"Satellites should use `runSapTransport` ([`transport.ts`](../../packages/sap-"
"contract/src/transport.ts)) for connect, heartbeat, and exponential backoff "
"reconnect (default 1s → 30s cap). On disconnect, Hub calls `onDisconnect` "
"and unregisters tools for that instance."
msgstr ""
"Satellite 应使用 `runSapTransport`（[`transport.ts`](../../packages/sap-"
"contract/src/transport.ts)）处理 connect、心跳与指数退避重连（默认 1s → 上限 "
"30s）。断开时 Hub 调用 `onDisconnect` 并注销该实例的工具。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:104
msgid "## RPC errors"
msgstr "## RPC 错误"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:106
msgid "Failed RPCs return `res` with `ok: false` and:"
msgstr "失败的 RPC 返回 `ok: false` 的 `res`，并附带："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:110
msgid "```json { \"code\": \"sap_error\", \"message\": \"...\" } ```"
msgstr "```json { \"code\": \"sap_error\", \"message\": \"...\" } ```"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/transport.md:111
msgid "See [methods.md](methods.md) for method-specific behavior."
msgstr "各方法的具体行为见 [methods.md](methods.md)。"
